> A hand-checkable calculation

A replacing trace set to1 decays by gamma*lambda=.95*.9=.855 after each step. Two decays leave.731025; repeated visits replace rather than add to that trace.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/td_lambda_worked.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -lpthread -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
